<name>Paris protests Sat 17 Oct (updated 10-16 20:30)</name>
<description>Route not agreed yet. The rally at Bastille at 14:00 is the only fixed point; the march will most likely head north towards République. Unofficial map built from press reports; check the Préfecture de police and RATP before travelling.</description>
<Style id="confirmed"><LineStyle><color>ff2c36d4</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>702c36d4</color></PolyStyle></Style>
