<Folder><name>Possible routes (not agreed)</name>
<Placemark><name>Alternative: Bd Richard-Lenoir (14:30–19:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>POSSIBLE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 14:30–19:30<br><br>Boulevards Beaumarchais and Richard-Lenoir are the classic routes north from Bastille. Nothing is set.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#possible</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.363241,48.866779,0 2.363007,48.867122,0 2.362961,48.867615,0 2.363048,48.867856,0 2.363423,48.868283,0 2.364016,48.868583,0 2.364368,48.868669,0 2.365112,48.868700,0 2.365817,48.868539,0 2.366981,48.867852,0 2.367185,48.867621,0 2.367377,48.867094,0 2.370845,48.865033,0 2.371492,48.864796,0 2.372000,48.864342,0 2.372987,48.863719,0 2.373568,48.863028,0 2.373902,48.862458,0 2.374141,48.861598,0 2.374088,48.860569,0 2.373901,48.859989,0 2.372716,48.857377,0 2.372586,48.857176,0 2.372180,48.856835,0 2.371583,48.856579,0 2.370340,48.856190,0 2.370687,48.854744,0 2.371312,48.854339,0 2.371574,48.853876,0 2.371598,48.853628,0 2.371428,48.853147,0 2.371099,48.852729,0 2.370536,48.852387,0 2.370190,48.852279,0 2.369434,48.852209,0 2.368366,48.852374,0 2.367766,48.852622,0 2.367343,48.852997,0 2.367011,48.853952,0 2.366318,48.856995,0 2.366524,48.857511,0 2.367032,48.857924,0 2.369327,48.858682,0 2.369779,48.859675,0 2.369811,48.859993,0 2.370133,48.860468,0 2.370297,48.860903,0 2.370268,48.861669,0 2.369961,48.862145,0 2.363635,48.865942,0 2.363302,48.866378,0 2.363241,48.866779,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Prefecture proposal: République → Place de Clichy (15:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>POSSIBLE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 15:00–20:00<br><br>The prefecture proposed a route between Bastille and Place de Clichy via Bd Magenta, Barbès and Pigalle, keeping marchers out of the centre. Organisers had not accepted it.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-le-cortege-341287.html">Affiches Parisiennes, 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#possible</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.326836,48.882199,0 2.325712,48.882704,0 2.325301,48.883157,0 2.325184,48.883681,0 2.325378,48.884195,0 2.325584,48.884423,0 2.326176,48.884778,0 2.326644,48.884939,0 2.327448,48.885026,0 2.328462,48.885598,0 2.329250,48.885761,0 2.330071,48.885704,0 2.332781,48.885076,0 2.337723,48.883608,0 2.338858,48.883416,0 2.346632,48.884895,0 2.349528,48.885221,0 2.349929,48.885214,0 2.350687,48.885047,0 2.351291,48.884700,0 2.351505,48.884475,0 2.351649,48.884227,0 2.351709,48.883790,0 2.357151,48.877734,0 2.358918,48.877477,0 2.359655,48.877149,0 2.359977,48.876894,0 2.360171,48.876643,0 2.360307,48.876090,0 2.360243,48.875811,0 2.359666,48.874923,0 2.364136,48.869932,0 2.364949,48.868881,0 2.365033,48.868620,0 2.364973,48.868114,0 2.365220,48.867556,0 2.365205,48.867290,0 2.364946,48.866790,0 2.364417,48.866393,0 2.364075,48.866253,0 2.363699,48.866160,0 2.362901,48.866128,0 2.362146,48.866300,0 2.360731,48.867127,0 2.360522,48.867349,0 2.360314,48.867853,0 2.360324,48.868115,0 2.360552,48.868588,0 2.360510,48.868664,0 2.355602,48.874150,0 2.355364,48.874606,0 2.355380,48.875080,0 2.354745,48.875309,0 2.354467,48.875490,0 2.353832,48.876119,0 2.348250,48.882336,0 2.347026,48.882168,0 2.345059,48.881774,0 2.344611,48.881614,0 2.343797,48.881530,0 2.341402,48.881062,0 2.34