<Placemark><name>Prefecture proposal: République → Nation (Bd Voltaire) (15:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>POSSIBLE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 15:00–20:00<br><br>Proposed by the prefecture for the student march; rejected by the organisers.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353967-october-17-mobilization-what-route-will-the-demonstration-in-paris-take">Sortiraparis, updated 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#possible</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.366483,48.867747,0 2.396680,48.849747,0 2.397115,48.849321,0 2.397279,48.848819,0 2.397150,48.848312,0 2.396574,48.847628,0 2.395943,48.847303,0 2.395172,48.847163,0 2.394379,48.847229,0 2.393685,48.847492,0 2.393195,48.847910,0 2.393017,48.848294,0 2.379491,48.856356,0 2.378623,48.856751,0 2.378270,48.857085,0 2.368413,48.862956,0 2.367666,48.863093,0 2.367035,48.863418,0 2.366803,48.863635,0 2.366584,48.864040,0 2.363525,48.865889,0 2.363167,48.866363,0 2.363110,48.866891,0 2.363199,48.867150,0 2.363594,48.867610,0 2.364225,48.867935,0 2.364996,48.868075,0 2.365789,48.868008,0 2.366483,48.867747,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Requested Gilets Jaunes march on the Champs-Élysées (12:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>POSSIBLE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 12:00–20:00<br><br>Requested from Étoile to the Rond-point des Champs-Élysées. The prefecture rejected a similar request last week, so a ban and a large police presence are likely.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#possible</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.306961,48.868288,0 2.294902,48.872111,0 2.294172,48.872466,0 2.293702,48.872979,0 2.293565,48.873572,0 2.293780,48.874154,0 2.294316,48.874638,0 2.295090,48.874949,0 2.295985,48.875040,0 2.296865,48.874897,0 2.297857,48.874591,0 2.310588,48.870512,0 2.311167,48.870085,0 2.311469,48.869548,0 2.311501,48.869260,0 2.311297,48.868475,0 2.310877,48.867944,0 2.310181,48.867560,0 2.309316,48.867381,0 2.308415,48.867435,0 2.307613,48.867714,0 2.307289,48.867926,0 2.306961,48.868288,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
