<Folder><name>Banned routes</name>
<Placemark><name>Banned route: Grands Boulevards to Concorde (13:00–21:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 13:00–21:00<br><br>The prefecture banned République → Concorde and Opéra → Bastille along the Grands Boulevards. A ban usually means heavy police presence, and unauthorised groups can still try to gather.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353967-october-17-mobilization-what-route-will-the-demonstration-in-paris-take">Sortiraparis, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.320332,48.864929,0 2.319662,48.865505,0 2.319306,48.866030,0 2.319266,48.866605,0 2.319369,48.866886,0 2.319549,48.867150,0 2.320083,48.867574,0 2.321999,48.870138,0 2.322278,48.870355,0 2.323506,48.871023,0 2.324359,48.871226,0 2.324813,48.871242,0 2.325612,48.871116,0 2.329835,48.871829,0 2.330308,48.872224,0 2.330677,48.872401,0 2.331534,48.872595,0 2.332438,48.872558,0 2.333081,48.872364,0 2.337279,48.873097,0 2.337792,48.873418,0 2.338629,48.873647,0 2.339082,48.873676,0 2.340120,48.873564,0 2.348478,48.872168,0 2.354081,48.870989,0 2.354674,48.870996,0 2.355118,48.870929,0 2.355533,48.870806,0 2.356031,48.870544,0 2.356725,48.870379,0 2.362082,48.869573,0 2.362769,48.869597,0 2.363214,48.869533,0 2.364006,48.869243,0 2.364323,48.869026,0 2.364738,48.868493,0 2.364820,48.868197,0 2.364718,48.867601,0 2.364537,48.867324,0 2.363766,48.866730,0 2.362865,48.866451,0 2.361871,48.866448,0 2.355549,48.867404,0 2.347428,48.869171,0 2.339968,48.870392,0 2.327230,48.868218,0 2.325467,48.867859,0 2.324273,48.866250,0 2.324259,48.865695,0 2.324124,48.865407,0 2.323614,48.864911,0 2.322857,48.864582,0 2.321968,48.864470,0 2.321081,48.864591,0 2.320332,48.864929,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Place de l'Opéra (original Gilets Jaunes start) (12:30–17:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 12:30–17:00<br><br>First announced as the Gilets Jaunes meeting point (speeches from 13:00), then banned. Some people may still turn up.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.335216,48.870999,0 2.335150,48.870558,0 2.334956,48.870134,0 2.334641,48.869743,0 2.334216,48.869400,0 2.333699,48.869119,0 2.333109,48.868910,0 2.332469,48.868782,0 2.331803,48.868738,0 2.331137,48.868782,0 2.330497,48.868910,0 2.329907,48.869119,0 2.329389,48.869400,0 2.328965,48.869743,0 2.328649,48.870134,0 2.328455,48.870558,0 2.328390,48.870999,0 2.328455,48.871440,0 2.328649,48.871864,0 2.328965,48.872255,0 2.329389,48.872598,0 2.329907,48.872879,0 2.330497,48.873088,0 2.331137,48.873217,0 2.331803,48.873260,0 2.332469,48.873217,0 2.333109,48.873088,0 2.333699,48.872879,0 2.334216,48.872598,0 2.334641,48.872255,0 2.334956,48.871864,0 2.335150,48.871440,0 2.335216,48.870999,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
